        <item>
            <title>0.2.5</title>
            <description sparkle:format="html"><![CDATA[
                <h3>What's new in v0.2.5</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>Added service-tier-aware cost estimates, applying the Fast/Priority multiplier when the rollout reports it.</li>
                    <li>Added bundled pricing for gpt-6-astra effective September 3, 2026, with improved historical pricing fallback.</li>
                    <li>Preserved service-tier data through usage history and indexes, and displayed it in session details so mixed-tier sessions are priced correctly.</li>
                </ul>
            ]]></description>
