        <item>
            <title>0.2.4</title>
            <description sparkle:format="html"><![CDATA[
                <h3>What's new in v0.2.4</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>Added a fallback for reading banked reset credits from the usage endpoint when the dedicated reset-credit endpoint is unavailable or rate-limited.</li>
                    <li>Added coverage for both snake_case usage payloads and camelCase app-server payloads.</li>
                </ul>
            ]]></description>
